{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">位於中國山西與陝西交界的黃河壺口瀑布，正值夏季最佳觀賞季節。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"8492374_壺口瀑布咆哮 盛夏觀瀑旺季 DONE - 截图1\" src=\"http://outin-63362ff8bc7011f09c8900163e08026a.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/27a5665f3557440e929cbdcc24195c7d/snapshots/2117fbe111b84cfa8efa0dca377c1474-00001.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"视频 8492374_壺口瀑布咆哮 盛夏觀瀑旺季 DONE 的第1张截图\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">這個瀑布是世上最大的黃色瀑布，奔騰咆哮的巨流在遊客面前傾瀉而下。不少遊客站在一旁石上的圍欄內觀看。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">根據旅游資訊網站，該景區的最佳觀賞季節是6至8月，因夏天水量充沛，可看到最壯觀的水流，不過這段時間遊客會較多。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:20.576473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}